hu.

521
00:21:45,430 --> 00:21:46,990
Yeh bahut balandi ki baat hai.

522
00:21:47,170 --> 00:21:48,750
Aam aadmi nahi samajh shakta hai.

523
00:21:50,910 --> 00:21:53,370
Toh masjid mein milo toh main tumko pahshan

524
00:21:53,370 --> 00:21:53,470
ta hu.

525
00:21:53,470 --> 00:21:55,030
Tumko maanta hain.

526
00:21:56,490 --> 00:21:57,270
Maan liye.

527
00:21:57,990 --> 00:21:58,510
Kya kar rahe hai?

528
00:21:58,610 --> 00:21:59,190
Namaaz para ho.

529
00:21:59,510 --> 00:22:02,670
Aur mandir mein milo toh main tumko jaan

530
00:22:02,670 --> 00:22:02,950
ta hu.

531
00:22:03,190 --> 00:22:03,850
Aap hai yah.

532
00:22:05,550 --> 00:22:06,450
Nahi maante hain.

533
00:22:06,870 --> 00:22:07,590
Maante nahi.

534
00:22:08,230 --> 00:22:09,470
Jaan te hain, magar maante nahi.

535
00:22:10,130 --> 00:22:11,090
Maante kahaan?

536
00:22:11,230 --> 00:22:11,750
Masjid mein.

537
00:22:13,670 --> 00:22:14,590
Har jage kaon hai?

538
00:22:14,910 --> 00:22:15,290
Allah ye.

539
00:22:15,290 --> 00:22:21,190
You have read so many books, so when

540
00:22:21,190 --> 00:22:23,750
you are able to understand it a little,

541
00:22:25,470 --> 00:22:26,430
you are able to understand it.

542
00:22:27,490 --> 00:22:29,590
Not every person can understand this thing.

543
00:22:32,070 --> 00:22:33,830
He tests them.

544
00:22:33,830 --> 00:22:36,310
He tests them in every possible way.

545
00:22:37,490 --> 00:22:43,350
And the people who come under the influence

546
00:22:43,350 --> 00:22:44,930
of Satan, they get confused.

547
00:22:45,850 --> 00:22:50,310
Now here, it is Allah who is coming

548
00:22:50,310 --> 00:22:51,490
in different forms.

549
00:22:52,390 --> 00:22:54,150
So He is testing me.

550
00:22:55,150 --> 00:22:58,450
So whatever you do, I believe you.

551
00:22:59,170 --> 00:23:00,110
And I don't believe anything else.

552
00:23:00,110 --> 00:23:00,870
I don't believe anything else.

553
00:23:01,610 --> 00:23:03,370
Who is bad and who is good?

554
00:23:04,610 --> 00:23:06,050
You are in every form perfectly.

555
00:23:06,970 --> 00:23:09,110
Whatever form you come in, there is nothing

556
00:23:09,110 --> 00:23:09,690
to worry about.

557
00:23:10,170 --> 00:23:11,090
I recognize you with this delicate form.

558
00:23:13,310 --> 00:23:14,250
This is it.

559
00:23:15,850 --> 00:23:17,130
Number six.

560
00:23:18,090 --> 00:23:20,350
Even by reading this verse, the dangers are

561
00:23:20,350 --> 00:23:21,850
lessened.

562
00:23:22,870 --> 00:23:23,450
What is it?

563
00:23:24,790 --> 00:23:27,370
If He wills, He will take you away

564
00:23:27,370 --> 00:23:30,050
and bring a new creation.

565
00:23:30,910 --> 00:23:34,130
And that is not difficult for Allah.
